        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPC-300, Modern 3 Inch Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3 inch Ring Pull is large enough for use on big furniture drawers such as dressers but it will also look great as a handle on closet doors, bathroom vanities, or even on kitchen cabinets. The circular cutout is very comfortable to hold. It is available in all 5 of the most popular finishes including polished chrome and oil rubbed bronze. It features easy screw on installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Smaller <a href=\"/products/2-inch-ring-pull-field-enterprises-rpc-200\">2\" Ring Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RPC300 Circle Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip: 3/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Grip Cutout Diameter: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
